              "text_BFQwKH": {
                "type": "text",
                "name": "t:names.text",
                "settings": {
                  "text": "<p>On 4 May 2013, The Games Cube began with a simple idea: create a gaming store built by players, for players, where knowledge, service and community mattered just as much as selling games.<br/>What started as a husband-and-wife business has grown into a dedicated team and one of Australia’s most established independent gaming stores. Today, The Games Cube is based in Parramatta and is widely recognised for its enormous Magic: The Gathering singles range.</p>",
                  "width": "100%",
                  "max_width": "none",
                  "alignment": "left",
                  "type_preset": "rte",
                  "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                  "font_size": "1rem",
