              "text_MDYatQ": {
                "type": "text",
                "name": "t:names.text",
                "settings": {
                  "text": "<p>From the beginning, Magic: The Gathering was at the heart of The Games Cube.<br/>Lindsay brought an extraordinary depth of tournament and organisational experience to the business. Before and alongside building The Games Cube, Lindsay was a Premier Event Tournament Organizer for the APAC region, organising Grand Prix and other major Magic events. He was also a Level 3 Judge, giving him an understanding of Magic that went far beyond simply knowing the cards.  <br/>That experience helped shape the philosophy of The Games Cube: if you're going to sell Magic, you should understand Magic.<br/>The connection to the competitive Magic community was evident early on. Lindsay was involved in organising major events including Grand Prix Sydney, Brisbane, Melbourne, Auckland and Hong Kong. <br/>Alex, meanwhile, brought a very different—and equally valuable—skill set. A Doctor of Astrophysics, Alex put her mathematical and analytical abilities to work behind the scenes, helping turn what began as a passion-driven business into a properly run and scalable company.<br/>Together, Lindsay and Alex created something unusual: a gaming business combining competitive Magic knowledge, mathematical precision, organisation and genuine love for the game.</p>",
                  "width": "100%",
                  "max_width": "none",
                  "alignment": "left",
                  "type_preset": "rte",
                  "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                  "font_size": "1rem",
                  "line_height": "normal",
                  "letter_spacing": "normal",
                  "case": "none",
                  "wrap": "pretty",
                  "text_color": "",
                  "background": false,
                  "background_color": "#00000026",
                  "corner_radius": 0,
                  "padding-block-start": 0,
