              "text_gAfK7X": {
                "type": "text",
                "name": "t:names.text",
                "settings": {
                  "text": "<p>From 4 May 2013 to today, The Games Cube has survived changing sets, changing formats, changing tournament structures, the explosion of online shopping and some extraordinary changes in the tabletop gaming industry.<br/>Yet the original philosophy remains.<br/>Know the game. Know the cards. Look after the players.<br/>The tiny beginnings have become an extensive singles business. And the knowledge gained from years of competitive Magic has been passed through the business into the service provided to every customer.<br/>There are plenty of places in Australia where you can buy a Magic card.<br/>But The Games Cube was built around the idea that Magic singles should be a specialty, not an afterthought.<br/>That's why, after more than a decade, The Games Cube remains one of Australia's great independent Magic destinations — and why its customers continue to regard it as the home of Magic singles in Australia.</p>",
                  "width": "100%",
                  "max_width": "none",
                  "alignment": "left",
                  "type_preset": "rte",
                  "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                  "font_size": "1rem",
                  "line_height": "normal",
